title: F5OS PSU
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/f5
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the power supply units of an F5 Networks rSeries appliance running
 F5OS. Reports status (Active, Standby, or Fault), input voltage and current,
 output power, and temperature for each PSU.

discovery:
 One service is created per power supply unit.
